  "question": {
    "text": "The correct match between item <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> and item <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math> is<br />&nbsp;<table border=\"1\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\">Item <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> (Compound)</td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\">Item <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math> (Reagent)</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>.</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Lysine</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>.</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo></math>naphthol</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>.</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Furfural</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>.</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Ninhydrin</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>.</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Benzyl alcohol</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>.</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>KMnO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>.</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Styrene</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>.</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Ceric ammonium nitrate</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>",
